Spec: Public connection operation wire values

Purpose:
  Encode formal connection requests and strictly correlate asynchronous operation and status replies.

Owns:
  ./ConnectionReply.java

References:
  ./ConnectionStatus.sdd
  ./ConnectionOpenRequest.sdd

Must:
  Expose a bounded standalone operation-value parser and immutable wire serialization for cross-language conformance; require canonical response UUIDs.
  Preserve caller-provided mutation UUIDs and correlate every response with its request and operation.
  Keep pending/reconciling results empty, successful results typed by connection or stream reference, and failed results mutually exclusive with success.
  Decode only bounded public DTOs and pass known Broker refusals without reflecting payloads or accepting arbitrary data endpoints.
